{"text":{"en":{"DR 200 | [회사명] 베어링":"DR 200 | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Power Lock</p> <h2>DR 200</h2> <p> 범용 타입 파워록으로 폴리, 기어, 폴라이휠, 레버, 캠 등 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">다양한 용도</strong>로 사용 가능합니다. 취부 및 해체가 용이합니다. </p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Power Lock</p> <h2>DR 200</h2> <p> A general-purpose power lock that can be used for <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">a wide range of applications</strong> such as pulleys, gears, flywheels, levers, and cams. Mounting and removal are easy. </p>","<strong>사양</strong><br> 표면 거칠기: Rt max 16μm · 가공 공차(Max): 축–h11, 허브–H11<br> 제품 주문 방법: DR200–d×D<sub>2</sub> (예: DR200–20×47)":"<strong>Specifications</strong><br> Surface Roughness: Rt max 16μm · Machining Tolerance (Max): Shaft–h11, Hub–H11<br> Ordering Method: DR200–d×D<sub>2</sub> (e.g. DR200–20×47)","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram1.webp\" alt=\"DR200 단면 도면\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=축지름 · D=허브지름 · B·L1·L2=폭 치수</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram1.webp\" alt=\"DR200 Cross-Section Drawing\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-Section<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Shaft Diameter · D=Hub Diameter · B·L1·L2=Width Dimensions</span></p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram2.webp\" alt=\"DR200 체결 예시\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 체결 예시</p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram2.webp\" alt=\"DR200 Mounting Example\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Mounting Example</p>","<strong>사양</strong><br> 표면 거칠기: Rt max 16μm &nbsp;·&nbsp; 가공 공차(Max): 축–h11, 허브–H11<br> 제품 주문 방법: DR200–d×D<sub>2</sub> (예: DR200–20×47)":"<strong>Specifications</strong><br> Surface roughness: Rt max 16μm &nbsp;·&nbsp; Machining tolerance (Max): shaft–h11, hub–H11<br> How to order: DR200–d×D<sub>2</sub> (e.g. DR200–20×47)"},"ja":{"DR 200 | [회사명] 베어링":"DR 200 | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Power Lock</p> <h2>DR 200</h2> <p> 범용 타입 파워록으로 폴리, 기어, 폴라이휠, 레버, 캠 등 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">다양한 용도</strong>로 사용 가능합니다. 취부 및 해체가 용이합니다. </p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Power Lock</p> <h2>DR 200</h2> <p> 汎用タイプのパワーロックで、プーリー、ギア、フライホイール、レバー、カムなど<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">様々な用途</strong>に使用できます。取り付け・取り外しが容易です。 </p>","<strong>사양</strong><br> 표면 거칠기: Rt max 16μm · 가공 공차(Max): 축–h11, 허브–H11<br> 제품 주문 방법: DR200–d×D<sub>2</sub> (예: DR200–20×47)":"<strong>仕様</strong><br> 表面粗さ: Rt max 16μm ・ 加工公差(Max): 軸–h11、ハブ–H11<br> 製品注文方法: DR200–d×D<sub>2</sub> (例: DR200–20×47)","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram1.webp\" alt=\"DR200 단면 도면\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=축지름 · D=허브지름 · B·L1·L2=폭 치수</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram1.webp\" alt=\"DR200 断面図\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=軸径 ・ D=ハブ径 ・ B・L1・L2=幅寸法</span></p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram2.webp\" alt=\"DR200 체결 예시\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 체결 예시</p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/dr200_diagram2.webp\" alt=\"DR200 取付例\" style=\"height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 取付例</p>","<strong>사양</strong><br> 표면 거칠기: Rt max 16μm &nbsp;·&nbsp; 가공 공차(Max): 축–h11, 허브–H11<br> 제품 주문 방법: DR200–d×D<sub>2</sub> (예: DR200–20×47)":"<strong>仕様</strong><br> 表面粗さ: Rt max 16μm &nbsp;·&nbsp; 加工公差(Max): 軸–h11、ハブ–H11<br> 製品